{"verb": "close down", "audio": "audio/38 - finishing/07-close-down.mp3", "duration": 33.384, "transcript": "A historic music hall in downtown Cleveland will close down at the end of December after fifty-three years of live performances. The owners said rising rent and fewer touring musicians made the decision unavoidable. Loyal regulars are organizing a final farewell concert with five local bands. The hall will be turned into a community arts space next year. Many performers said their careers began on its small wooden stage and called the news the end of an era.", "words": [{"word": "A", "start": 0.08, "end": 0.12, "score": 0.996}, {"word": "historic", "start": 0.16, "end": 0.661, "score": 0.803}, {"word": "music", "start": 0.741, "end": 1.042, "score": 0.937}, {"word": "hall", "start": 1.062, "end": 1.282, "score": 0.852}, {"word": "in", "start": 1.403, "end": 1.483, "score": 0.856}, {"word": "downtown", "start": 1.543, "end": 2.024, "score": 0.903}, {"word": "Cleveland", "start": 2.084, "end": 2.505, "score": 0.939}, {"word": "will", "start": 2.685, "end": 2.866, "score": 0.958}, {"word": "close", "start": 2.906, "end": 3.186, "score": 0.747}, {"word": "down", "start": 3.246, "end": 3.487, "score": 0.834}, {"word": "at", "start": 3.647, "end": 3.707, "score": 0.804}, {"word": "the", "start": 3.747, "end": 3.867, "score": 0.613}, {"word": "end", "start": 3.968, "end": 4.088, "score": 0.841}, {"word": "of", "start": 4.148, "end": 4.208, "score": 0.75}, {"word": "December", "start": 4.268, "end": 4.729, "score": 0.917}, {"word": "after", "start": 5.13, "end": 5.37, "score": 0.733}, {"word": "fifty-three", "start": 5.451, "end": 6.072, "score": 0.814}, {"word": "years", "start": 6.132, "end": 6.412, "score": 0.677}, {"word": "of", "start": 6.533, "end": 6.613, "score": 0.834}, {"word": "live", "start": 6.693, "end": 6.994, "score": 0.823}, {"word": "performances.", "start": 7.134, "end": 7.855, "score": 0.861}, {"word": "The", "start": 9.158, "end": 9.278, "score":